Meta/

# tests/testthat/_snaps/ is deliberately NOT ignored. testthat compares output
# against the committed snapshot, so ignoring it would make every run write a
# fresh baseline and the assertion could never fail. The scaffold this repo
# started from ignored it; that was a mistake, not a policy.

# Fiberplane local issue tracking
.fp/

# Timestamp of the last successful `tools/verify.sh full`. Local state about
# one machine's checkout, not a property of the source.
.verify-stamp
